  tree -L 2                  → Show directory tree 2 levels deep

FILE OPERATIONS
  cp -r src/ dest/           → Copy directory recursively
  mv old.txt new.txt         → Move/rename a file
  rm -rf dir/                → Delete directory forcefully (use with caution!)
  touch file.txt             → Create empty file / update timestamp
  cat file.txt               → Print file content
  less file.txt              → View file with paging (press q to quit)
  head -n 20 file.txt        → First 20 lines of file
  tail -f /var/log/app.log   → Follow log file in real time
  wc -l file.txt             → Count lines in file

TEXT PROCESSING (BIG IN FAANG)
  grep -r "error" /var/log/  → Search text recursively in directory
  grep -i "warn" app.log     → Case-insensitive search
  awk '{print $1, $3}' f     → Print columns 1 and 3
